{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "b6745e7b6d935dd3284c5f22e55360f859e017946b3ed8a72a9fbb11a9fc552c", "ja": "夢のような日々を、笑顔で", "zh": "带着笑容，度过如梦般的每一天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e24c15a28c9e12ad0ca7d7ee4daf8bcb3823efcfe1d14f8b68df19690046e39", "ja": "初回リハで気負い過ぎる紬。プロデューサー\nはその時できることを、お客さんと一緒に\n楽しんでほしいと語る。みんなの家、劇場で\n笑顔で迎えるため……紬はそう思い直して\n着実に一歩ずつ進む覚悟を決めるのだった。", "zh": "第一次彩排时，紬过于紧张。制作人表示，希望她能和观众一起享受当下力所能及的事情。为了在大家的家——剧场里笑着迎接大家……紬重新振作起来，下定决心踏踏实实地一步一步前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c990a9c11284abe8fb3a74901900a0c30dcd5fd0c67f289f4aa0685f9f56b046", "ja": "第1回定期公演、初回リハを終え……", "zh": "第1次定期公演，首次彩排结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "ba86dc602ac6fc95ac6cb4bfa7ddc7dd8f6d118a7e88dfed3e68c248033e8bb4", "ja": "紬、お疲れさま。とりあえず全体を通してみたけど\n……うん、まだ、難しそうだな。", "zh": "紬，辛苦了。我姑且从头到尾试了一遍……嗯，还是很难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aacb7bd76ecd1df591dd9c95e094778c75acae2ec63a85325e59b26696710017", "ja": "……難しそうではなく、難しいのです。\n歌も踊りも、身についていなくて……。", "zh": "……不是看起来困难，而是很困难。\n无论唱歌还是跳舞，我都还没掌握好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a8b5ee1ea82736b402b295c25b571bdc79d17b776467b21da1ff67313ee9a46a", "ja": "はっ。もしかして、貴方は落ち込んでいる私をさらに\n落ち込ませるために、わざわざ確認しにきたのですか？", "zh": "哈。难道您是特意来确认一下，好让情绪低落的我变得更加消沉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "f18abfe6a930c61717ce653fc8e8a3d09e28cb9de573fe5ac78c0554cd3eb277", "ja": "ち、違う違う！　ほら苦戦してるみたいだったから、\nまずは声をかけただけで！", "zh": "不、不是不是！看你好像遇到了困难，所以我只是先来跟你说句话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7757476aa390ca1582613ef2e12892781260bcf6c0902ce08eda8f5be8c755ec", "ja": "みたいではなく、苦戦しているのです！\n今回は私達5人だけでセトリをやりきるのですから！", "zh": "不是“好像”，而是正在苦战！\n\n这次可是要只靠我们5个人完成整套歌单的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c7a84ee9d0f1cd9ec5f7fc65b7aea7207b03846ab2b5055a70d88bd46d2fc0de", "ja": "覚える曲は一気に増えましたし、もう覚えた曲は\nより洗練させなくてはいけませんし……！", "zh": "要记的歌曲一下子增加了这么多，已经记住的歌曲也必须进一步打磨才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "1c4c8a58ac7cab59d6b626d82b9ccf5fcb238e153a21da3cf8f863e3cc8759a0", "ja": "そ、そうだよな。\nもちろん、大変だと思う……。", "zh": "是、是啊。\n当然，我觉得肯定很辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b0a831f9b4ef18f18c100fbef9a2a3eceabc7ee24d6de676d4153c70d550071f", "ja": "……こけら落とし公演を終えて、この劇場はもう\nたくさんの人にとっての大切な場所となりました。", "zh": "……在完成开幕演出后，这座剧场已经成为许多人心中重要的地方了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "daea60ac3a5b6280c8400a4bebd72befcd8d67d7d571a470cad5d00c812b0c35", "ja": "私の、だけではなく。私達の……もしかしたら、\nお客様方も含めた、みなさんのお家……。", "zh": "不只是我的，也是我们的……说不定，还包括各位客人在内，是大家的家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "e5300433ab7246a90d1b18fbd30dc25b6f0cd48da0a995fc0e1c5836ebcd528d", "ja": "お家……。", "zh": "家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "882c49ffa83bf0d2222d162d61e63346c846586d29ac34b51645e262e7328a94", "ja": "その始まりとなる、第1回定期公演。最高のスタートで\n飾って、次に繋がなくてはいけません。", "zh": "作为这一切开端的第1次定期公演，必须以最棒的开场拉开序幕，为之后打下基础。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e572271df0a0b9fb2b37df6e2bf9ac200edbc20165d7aa14867c048457786f30", "ja": "ですが気が急くばかりで時間はいたずらに過ぎていき、\n歌詞やフリは一向に入ってこず……ううう……っ！", "zh": "可是越着急，时间反而白白流逝，歌词和舞蹈动作完全记不进去……呜呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9bf029a0da0ad99d93eb9585f28cfc2a292c9acade72a326ec3cd1c2dad5159a", "ja": "はううううう～～～っ！！！！！", "zh": "呜呜呜呜呜～～～！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "f438456246fdfb53b8e0acf92aafe47392d3831c09b744d9299081ae5ffe47e5", "ja": "ああっ、ぐるぐるしちゃってる！\nま、まずは落ち着こう、紬！", "zh": "啊啊，转个不停！\n先、先冷静下来，紬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "fa36cfbe67efb9effb3884581504b0fce74d45e4fbecf6b0dd89381ad975c181", "ja": "ふう。いろいろ考えてくれているのは嬉しいけど……\nでも、ちょっと考え過ぎなのかもな。", "zh": "呼……你愿意替我考虑这么多，我很高兴……\n不过，或许你确实想得有点太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "12e8e618c970e6d006cd84e59aa7aad17aff1034a67ae7b63d678dbac04c2681", "ja": "1回目の定期公演だからとか、そういうのは正直、\n忘れたほうがいいと思う。ほら、些細なことだから。", "zh": "说实话，我觉得最好把“这是第1次定期公演”\n这类事给忘掉。你看，毕竟只是些小事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "32d092eccf13fbde3ee70611fb5f239faa6c7accb1623f645ab60e4d0c839a8b", "ja": "……は？　なにを……？\n1回目の定期公演は、些細なことではありませんっ！", "zh": "……哈？您在说……什么？\n第1次定期公演，才不是微不足道的小事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "fefdc003effb8eb2c2ebe29a2e2bcd07c0956d4ffe560af2acc96c8cb2ff9120", "ja": "でも、1回目だけの特別にすごいステージとか、\nそういうのを見せて欲しいわけじゃないんだ。", "zh": "但是，我并不是想让你们只在第1次定期公演时，给我看那种特别厉害的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "227986d123ea84e3a59bdac8c1b029997a23c4307c96408d9726caf6d5cbfbbc", "ja": "定期公演はこれからもずっと続いていく。だから、\nその時にできることを、見せてくれればいい。", "zh": "定期公演今后也会一直办下去。所以，\n只要展现出你当时能做到的表现就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0cb8d47a84b29253931f3a2e897c5fd1a0a2f8a45bf758efc65d085224654164", "ja": "……。その時に、できること？", "zh": "……。在那时，能做到的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "dd6264874677cee4321ad2ccaa3f625c3345f2731fc4a4708fc3b87719a5174a", "ja": "もちろん、失敗とかはしない方がいいけど、\n大事なのはそこじゃないと思う。それより……", "zh": "当然，虽然能不失败是最好，不过我觉得重要的并不是这个。比起这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "e6fe7ae4850e72f0b7342fe9b8f52bda40fff85acccffa2de5a219102a09c480", "ja": "お客さんに楽しんでもらうことが一番じゃないか。\nここがみんなのお家なら、なおさらね。", "zh": "让客人享受其中才是最重要的吧。\n如果这里是大家的家，那就更应该如此了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8110865be0c5ee16f9aa680a1814b8dbe463fe6b4f4f609d2bffa265b4c621e3", "ja": "それは……。あの……。", "zh": "那是……那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f6bba35427307e4ed2d389553e5a6706c9de733163cf40e811a2b19df8b5cc7a", "ja": "お、おためごかしというものです。どちらにしても、\nたくさんの曲を覚えることに変わりありませんっ。", "zh": "这、这是所谓的惺惺作态。无论如何，\n都还是要记住很多歌曲，这一点并没有改变！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "4be90133e1efd8a4aff174fb588850908ddd827b5d50cce3bdb0336ab0346507", "ja": "あはは、そうなんだけど。\nでも……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，虽然是那样没错。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "46da41eb8115952d6c2663188710cd2298940380186f24b5bafa96f87b9a21c2", "ja": "はい。でも、大丈夫です。\nおかげさまで私も……、その、覚悟が決まりました。", "zh": "是的。不过，没关系。\n多亏了您，我也……那个，已经下定决心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "da84e7939e6945b9de6153f567365ff4049e32376f8f623667ec7cbf47bb6732", "ja": "あれ？　いや、\n覚悟を決めて欲しかったわけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "咦？不，\n我并不是想让你做好什么心理准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0187d589f27e1edd5b6c47a9c91c312be08ba51e96d4f5583e3e4aca3d9e4a24", "ja": "気負いすぎない覚悟です。もちろん、失敗してもいい\nなんて、無責任なことは考えていません。", "zh": "是不必太过逞强的决心。当然，我并没有想过“就算失败也没关系”这种不负责任的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "38641303ec6243ffb74a1211a3671d6ba01d8bf7510126560785339248e911ec", "ja": "ただ、何よりも……、笑顔でお迎えしたい。\nそう、思い直しただけです。", "zh": "不过，比什么都重要的是……我想用笑容迎接大家。  \n只是重新这样想了而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "e31a67d860fdf78298124f568e8a30a93c7163f9f36cf73d5a494c97e5f28d99", "ja": "あ……。うん、そうだな。\nそのために、紬もアイドルを楽しんで行こう！", "zh": "啊……嗯，说得对。\n为此，紬也一起享受偶像活动吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0331_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_02_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "677c2dea755b5be81e0283657c8833be2937b628eb75403562d23d2bb16da713", "ja": "……。そうですね。\nアイドルを……この夢のような日々を、大切に……。", "zh": "……。是啊。\n当偶像……这宛如梦境般的每一天，都要好好珍惜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
